## What shipped (14 files, all `Layout.*`)
- **Pure core** (`Layout.Adapter`/`Layout.Projector`/`Layout.Nav`): the full 19-section / 100-destination `navSections` catalog (SF-Symbol mapped) + verbatim ports of every web nav rule — visibility (`minVehicles`/`requiresAuth`), active-path matching, pinned/recent resolution (cap 8/3), pin/unpin, section-toggle (active never collapses), and badge math (alerts 9+ / fleet uncapped / stale 9+).
- **State** (`Layout.Seams`/`Layout.Strings`/`Layout.Model`): P1/S8 source seam, P1/S11 telemetry (`view.opened` once), P1/S10 i18n facade (all **20 web keys** + native chrome/a11y), `@Observable @MainActor` holder with phases + stale-auto-refresh-once.
- **Views** (`Layout.Views`/`Layout.Chrome`/`Layout.Shell`/`Layout.swift`/`Layout.Previews`): grouped sidebar (active card + pin toggle, pinned group, collapsible sections, expand/collapse-all, count badges), header (brand/theme-switcher/bell), content region (Outlet slot + quick-search hint), adaptive regular/compact layout, and every leaf state.
- **Tests**: 54 XCTest assertions (adapter + model + view-composition + strings).

